{"data":{"id":"UY6mykDqs8A","slug":"scientist","title":"Scientist","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"WKDBlUPrO0U","slug":"plague-of-zombies","title":"Plague Of Zombies"},{"id":"JnIt5xnPCmA","slug":"ghost-of-frankenstein","title":"Ghost of Frankenstein"}]},"markers":[{"id":"qlpJWcD68d0","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Scientist - Ghost Of Frankenstein","track":{"id":"JnIt5xnPCmA","path":"/artists/scientist/tracks/ghost-of-frankenstein/","slug":"ghost-of-frankenstein","title":"Ghost of Frankenstein","artist":{"slug":"scientist","title":"Scientist"},"artwork":"images/artists/scientist/tracks/ghost-of-frankenstein.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"lgfJzKl9OGs","position":16,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Scientist - Ghost Of Frankenstein","track":{"id":"JnIt5xnPCmA","path":"/artists/scientist/tracks/ghost-of-frankenstein/","slug":"ghost-of-frankenstein","title":"Ghost of Frankenstein","artist":{"slug":"scientist","title":"Scientist"},"artwork":"images/artists/scientist/tracks/ghost-of-frankenstein.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"vP3Z9SfYSTo","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Scientist - Ghost Of Frankenstein","track":{"id":"JnIt5xnPCmA","path":"/artists/scientist/tracks/ghost-of-frankenstein/","slug":"ghost-of-frankenstein","title":"Ghost of Frankenstein","artist":{"slug":"scientist","title":"Scientist"},"artwork":"images/artists/scientist/tracks/ghost-of-frankenstein.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Ym8VGymWIs","slug":"228","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-228"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #228","artwork":"/images/episodes/228.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688"